ADDITIONAL NOTICE — model weights and data

This licence covers the source code and documentation in this repository.
It does NOT cover:

  * The weights of any third-party models the system loads at runtime.
    Those are governed by their own licences and terms of use, which must
    be reviewed independently before any distribution or commercial use.

  * Any third-party corpus used to seed the scenario bank. Each corpus
    carries its own licence and redistribution terms; see DATA_CARD.md.
    Corpora are not redistributed with this repository.

  * Human-labelled calibration data, session recordings, and any material
    under data/ — none of which is published (see .gitignore).
